#: ../../tools/zfin_tools.rst:32 3021349e1ba845fa8f982899fe00222e
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed information about a specific zebrafish "
"allele from ZFIN via the Alliance of Genome Resources. Returns allele "
"symbol, associated gene, alteration type, species, and synonyms. Useful "
"for looking up specific zebrafish mutant lines. Example: 'ZFIN:ZDB-"
"ALT-210706-1' returns the szu2 allele of pax2a with its deletion variant "
"details."
msgstr ""

